      "text": "whole earth was … of one speech, Gen. 11:1. I am slow of speech, Ex. 4:10 (Moses 6:31). my speech shall distil as the dew, Deut. 32:2. cried with a loud voice in the Jews’ speech, 2 Chr. 32:18. imagine to reprove … speeches of one that is desperate, Job 6:26. Excellent speech becometh not a fool, Prov. 17:7. thy speech shall be low out of the dust, Isa. 29:4 (2 Ne. 26:16). Thou shalt not see … a people of a deeper speech, Isa. 33:19. thou art not sent to a people of a strange speech, Ezek. 3:5.",
